title: "Multi-hazard remote sensing in Nepal — systematic review pipeline"
abstract: >-
  Reproducible search, de-duplication, screening, and prioritisation workflow for a
  systematic/hybrid review of remote-sensing and geospatial approaches to multi-hazard
  monitoring in Nepal (2016–2025), covering Scopus and Web of Science.
